      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/imtheatan/status/1987189854795669587",
      "text": "Kiko Barzaga released this video today on his FB timeline. First lines pa lang mali-mali na. \n\nFYI, Pres. Marcos did not issue an arrest warrant against Bato dela Rosa. The ICC allegedly did. \n\nBato dela Rosa was the implementor of Duterte’s “war on drugs”. Dapat lang managot sya sa ICC, di ba? \n\nDuterte was not arrested by Marcos. The Interpol did. The PNP cooperated because the Philippines is an Interpol member. \n\nIf makukukong man si Sen. Bong Go, Sen. Joel Villanueva, and Sen. Rodante Marcoleta, dapat ang tanong mo: ano ba ang kaso nila? Non-bailable ba ang kaso nila? \n\nBakit ikukulong kung walang kasalanan? \n\nUnahan mo kaya mag-rally sa Malacañang? Yung Forbes Park rally mo nga nilangaw. Pumunta ka lang dun para magpa photo-ops tapos umalis ka naman kaagad!",
