        "url": "https://x.com/clarkron_2008/status/1987175624562319617",
        "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/clarkron_2008/status/1987175624562319617",
        "text": "Typhoon Uwan (Fung-wong), the 21st tropical cyclone of 2025 in the Philippines, is rapidly intensifying and posing a significant threat with potential super typhoon status, bringing torrential rains and destructive winds. Its massive 1,400-kilometer diameter means it will impact Luzon primarily, but the Visayas and Mindanao will also feel its effects. PAGASA has issued warnings for floods, landslides, and storm surges, urging the public to stay alert and monitor official updates on the typhoon’s track, wind signals, rainfall, and storm surges, as well as viewing the latest news, photos, and videos from affected areas.\n\nDito sa akim walang Ulan pero lumalakas bigla at tumitigil ang hangin.\n#UwanPH",
